cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. The data come from the US Energy Information Administration."
type: dataset
title: "US Utility Residential Electricity Prices, Monthly since 1990"
abstract: >
  Average residential electricity price, bill and use at the 40 biggest US electric utilities, every month since
  January 1990, from returns filed with the US Energy Information Administration (Form 826, EIA-861M and EIA-861),
  merged across corporate changes, with outages, net-metered rooftop solar, supply split and counties served.
